    "## Project workflow\n",
    "1. preprocessing and EDA\n",
    "- datatype conversion\n",
    "- data cleaning: missing values, irregular dates(); prophet is able to handle missing values but we'll still do it\n",
    "\n",
    "- decompose the data and visualize the components using a line plot to see the trends, seasonalities \n",
    "\n",
    "2. modeling\n",
    "- create a base model, fit and predict\n",
    "- asses the model perfomance and set its metrics as the refference value for future model iterations\n",
    "- create a future dataframe and asses the model components\n",
    "- visualize the predictions and actual values\n",
    "\n",
    "3. model tuning\n",
    "- tune the models hyperparameters for better perfomance\n",
    "- asses perfomance & visualize the actual vs predicted values\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "4. interpret the components\n",
    "- trend - increasing or decreasing\n",
    "- seasonalities - what are the dominant cycles; yearly, weekly, asses holiday effect \n",
    "- business insights\n",
    "- translate the forecast into actionable reccomendations"
   ]
